
Product Requirements Document (PRD)

AI Tool to Generate Governance Platform Admin Console Prototype

1. Product Overview

Product Name

Adam.ai Admin Console Prototype Generator

Purpose

The purpose of this product is to create an AI-generated interactive prototype of the administrative configuration console used to manage the governance platform.

The prototype will demonstrate how administrators configure:
	•	Identity and authentication policies
	•	User lifecycle and governance roles
	•	Organisation and multi-organisation access
	•	Governance content protection rules
	•	Device and application security controls
	•	Audit logging and compliance policies
	•	Platform integrations such as national identity systems

This tool generates a functional prototype, not production software.

The prototype allows stakeholders to validate:
	•	Administrative UX
	•	Configuration model
	•	Security architecture
	•	Governance workflows

2. Problem Statement

The governance platform includes numerous security, identity, and governance configuration capabilities across multiple initiatives.

Currently these capabilities are documented separately, but there is no unified administrative control surface defined.

Administrators need a single console where they can configure:
	•	authentication policies
	•	governance permissions
	•	document protection
	•	device behaviour
	•	audit logging
	•	multi-organisation identity

The goal of this prototype is to demonstrate how these capabilities are configured in practice.

