20. AI Prototype Prompt Template

Example prompt:

Generate a SaaS admin console UI for a governance platform.

The console manages identity policies, governance roles, user lifecycle, device security rules, content protection policies, and audit logging.

The interface should include sidebar navigation, configuration panels, role management tables, policy toggles, and an audit log viewer.

21. Acceptance Criteria

The prototype is successful if it:
	•	demonstrates the admin configuration architecture
	•	includes all capability domains
	•	supports governance role configuration
	•	supports device security configuration
	•	includes content protection controls
	•	includes audit logging interface
	•	demonstrates multi-organisation access configuration

Final Outcome

The AI tool will generate a fully navigable prototype admin console demonstrating how governance platform configuration works.

The prototype allows stakeholders to validate:
	•	administrative workflows
	•	security policy configuration
	•	governance permission models
	•	compliance capabilities

If you’d like, I can also produce one more thing that will dramatically improve the AI prototype output: a structured settings schema (basically the configuration JSON model) that the AI tool can use to generate the UI automatically.

